\pard\b\fs20 War of Cra-Kla-Zoth\b0\par
\fs16\par
When the Council of Cra-Kla-Zoth formed as an alliance of wise mages during the war of faith, the two warring churches feared they would lose their position of power to the new authority. So for the first time, the two formerly hostile churches joined forces in an alliance, the League of the Gods, to move against the Council.\par
The goal of this melee is for the paladins to destroy the statue at the top of the Council's tower. The mages, on the other hand, have to try to wipe out the paladins.\par
